OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FHuge red flames were seen engulfing
OL,7,Fthe Croatian coastal village of Lokva
OL,8,FRogoznica as a blaze broke out on
OL,9,FThursday evening
OL,11,FAt least 2,000 people have been forced
OL,12,Fto evacuate from the path of massive
OL,13,Fblaze in Croatia as wildfires continue
OL,14,Fto burn across Europe amid record-
OL,15,Fbreaking heat.
OL,17,FA total of 157 firefighters and 44
OL,18,Ffire engines were deployed to Lokva
OL,19,FRogoznica - a coastal village 23 miles
OL,20,Fsouth of Split - after the blaze broke
OL,21,Fout on Thursday evening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
