PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786841293
OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FVideo footage shows monstrous red
OL,7,Fflames engulfing the area. Several
OL,8,Fhomes were destroyed and cars were
OL,9,Fburnt.
OL,11,FBy Friday morning the blaze had spread
OL,12,Ftoward the city of Omis and the Borak
OL,13,Fneighbourhood, forcing at least 2,000
OL,14,Fresidents and tourists to evacuate.
OL,15,FSeven people remained in life-
OL,16,Fthreatening condition early Friday.
OL,18,F"We were evacuated from our home, I'm
OL,19,Fnot expecting much to be left today,"
OL,20,Fresident Nadalina Aqua Marina said on
OL,21,Fsocial media.
OL,26,@tD@Wy
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
