PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786841293
OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FFirefighters put out the blaze by
OL,7,FFriday morning as other crews in
OL,8,Fplanes headed further south toward the
OL,9,FPeljesac peninsula where another
OL,10,Fwildfire broke out overnight.
OL,12,FAltogether, 36 people from Omis sought
OL,13,Fmedical care. Fourteen were
OL,14,Fhospitalized, including the seven with
OL,15,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,17,FWitnesses told Croatian broadcaster
OL,18,FHRT that people were jumping into the
OL,19,Fsea after boats also caught fire.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
