PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786841293
OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FCroatian newspaper, Jutarnji list, is
OL,7,Freporting an elderly woman is missing.
OL,8,FChief Fire Chief Slavko Tucakovic told
OL,9,Fthe paper that he had never
OL,10,Fexperienced such a fire in his life.
OL,11,FHe also said burning vehicles may have
OL,12,Fcontributed to the spread of the fire.
OL,14,FEvacuees, most of whom are foreign
OL,15,Ftourists, sort refuge at the Gripe
OL,16,FSports Centre, according to local
OL,17,Fmedia.
OL,26,@pD@arq
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
