OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FFire services struggled to tackle the
OL,7,Fblaze as strong winds fuel the flames.
OL,8,FDry conditions threaten the landscape
OL,9,Fas no rainfall is expected in the
OL,10,Fupcoming days.
OL,12,FBritish tourist Maxine Jones described
OL,13,Fon Facebook how she and her family
OL,14,Ffled to Split and slept on a hotel
OL,15,Ffloor.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
