OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,F"We managed to escape last night
OL,7,F(Thursday) and drove to Split. We
OL,8,Ffound a hotel that is fully booked but
OL,9,Fthey allowed us four adults and our
OL,10,Ftwo grandchildren to stay on their
OL,11,Fconference room floor. They have been
OL,12,Fextremely kind," she said.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, complex and fast-moving
OL,20,Fwildfires also raged across Spain on
OL,21,FFriday.
