OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FIn Huesca province, the Las Penas de
OL,7,FRiglos wildfire, which was reported to
OL,8,Fbe 50% contained on Thursday,
OL,9,Freignited with considerable intensity
OL,10,Fand forced further evacuations
OL,11,Fovernight and into Friday morning,
OL,12,Freports said.
OL,14,FConservationists have worked to save
OL,15,Fartefacts from the Monastery of San
OL,16,FJuan de la Pena, one of the most
OL,17,Fimportant monasteries in Aragon in the
OL,18,FMiddle Ages, as the blaze edges closer.
OL,26,@nD@_TwxD@NTw
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
