OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FIn Niebla, in the Huelva province, a
OL,7,Ffire has burned more than 31,000
OL,8,Fhectares since igniting on August 6
OL,9,Fand has spread to several new areas
OL,10,Fwithin the province of Seville.
OL,12,FAlso on Friday, 1,800 people were
OL,13,Fevacuated from their homes in western
OL,14,FGermany as a forest fire spread in the
OL,15,FGey district of the Eifel municipality
OL,16,Fof Hurtgenwald.
OL,18,FWhile the fire initially affected an
OL,19,Farea of about 25 hectares, it has
OL,20,Fsince spread to twelve times the size
OL,21,Fat approximately 300 hectares.
OL,26,@xD@Exz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
