OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FLocal officials said 300 emergency
OL,7,Fresponders, three helicopters and two
OL,8,Farmed forces tanks were actively
OL,9,Ftackling the blaze on site.
OL,11,FOn Thursday evening a "major disaster
OL,12,Fsituation" was declared, with a
OL,13,Fprimary school in the Stras district
OL,14,Fand the nearby sports and shooting
OL,15,Fclubs receiving those affected.
OL,17,FHundreds of firefighters were deployed
OL,18,Fto tackle a new fire in the Landes
OL,19,Fregion, on the southwest coast of
OL,20,FFrance, and more than 500 people were
OL,21,Fevacuated on Thursday.
