OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FFrance is experiencing its driest year
OL,7,Fon record, and on Thursday
OL,8,Ftemperatures hit 41C.JCooler and
OL,9,Fwetter regions in the north of France,
OL,10,Fsuch as Brittany, have also been
OL,11,Fimpacted by fires.
OL,13,FIn northern Greece, 500 tourists and
OL,14,Fresidents were evacuated from beaches
OL,15,Fand resorts as a large wildfire burned
OL,16,F1,400 hectares on the Chalkidiki
OL,17,Fpeninsula, damaging homes and vehicles.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
