OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FA total of 227 firefighters, 57
OL,7,Fvehicles, 13 ground units, six
OL,8,Ffirefighting planes and a helicopter
OL,9,Fwere deployed to battle the blaze,
OL,10,Fwhich was largely tamed overnight
OL,11,Faccording to news reports.
OL,13,FIn Italy, a large blaze broke out in
OL,14,FComo on Thursday night, with
OL,15,Ffirefighters and helicopters deployed
OL,16,Fin an attempt to extinguish the flames.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
