OL,3,CCroatian blaze forces thousands to
OL,4,Cflee as wildfires rage across Europe
OL,6,FCloser to home, the UK reported its
OL,7,Fhottest day of the year on Thursday
OL,8,Fwith temperatures surpassing 38C.
OL,9,FWildfires raged across Wales, Norfolk
OL,10,Fand in the West Midlands, where six
OL,11,Fhomes were destroyed and a child and
OL,12,Fthree firefighters were taken to
OL,13,Fhospital.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
